module
public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Triality.ElementaryCentralKernel.FixedRootCommutant.Coordinates

/-!
# The four constant fixed roots

These sparse matrices are the central simple roots of both signs at 1 and the
products of the three arm roots of both signs at 1. The binary coefficient
identities are checked in the kernel and transported to every ring of
characteristic two.

Source: the fixed-root parametrizations of GLS3 §2.4.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Triality.Standard.ElementaryCentralKernel.FixedRootCommutant

